---
globs: ["**/*.{ts,tsx}"]
alwaysApply: false
---
Stencil decorators + TS. Prefer explicit interfaces for `@Prop` contracts. Avoid new `any` unless matching existing callback props.
Naming: components/classes PascalCase, files kebab-case folders, constants ALL_CAPS, enums PascalCase.
Keep methods focused; extract shared logic to `src/utils/`. Match existing formatting (Prettier).
